   "stem_html": "<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n  <thead></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"row\">        Miles from Home, <span data-math=\"x\">x</span></th>\n      <td>\n        0\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        5\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        10\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"row\">        Miles from School, <span data-math=\"y\">y</span></th>\n      <td>\n        30\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        25\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        20\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n <br> <p>Using the table above, what is an equation that shows the relationship between miles from home and miles from school?</p>",
